m information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Ti Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9159) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700H (20 threads) - 63.69 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot project manager, the editor and any game made in godot will open with a default/fallback icon in windows 11 taskbar.\nI have a multi monitor setup, but i also tested without the external monitors and the issue happens 100% of the time.\n\nOpening godot project manager\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b049c05-d483-4496-a15b-6a48b0ddd34c\n\nOpening a game made with godot\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/660da4d3-3f89-444d-9dda-af13990b6694\n\n\nMaybe related:\n- Games made with godot seems to always open on main window, and after the initial load, when the icon is updated, it moves to the monitor where it previously was closed\n- Godot project manager ALWAYS open in main monitor\n- Godot editor opens in the correct monitor (where is was last closed/used)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen godot project manager, godot editor or any game made in godot\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAny godot project","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.gi